# NOTE: the lakehouse package + table_registry.yaml + generate_source_data.py +
# init_ods.sql are VENDORED IN (committed) so this project builds standalone.
# scripts/sync-lakehouse.sh refreshes them from databricks_lakehouse when that
# sibling project is present, and is a no-op (uses the committed copies) when it
# isn't. Treat a sync diff as "vendored deps updated" and commit it deliberately.

# ConfigMap manifests rendered from the vendored files (see scripts/sync-lakehouse.sh).
# The hand-authored minio-creds.yaml is committed; these two are generated.
k8s/config/lakehouse-config.generated.yaml
k8s/config/pg-init.generated.yaml

